<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>5.  All of the "Ship to" information should be filled in automatically for you.  The "Bill to" information will also be automatically filled in by the system.  If you want to change these names, click on the arrow </run><picture
