<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>6. (NEW - Added to the august 2009 release) Type the Floor and Room information under the "Ship to" information.  The Floor and Room information will be used to deliver the ordered items.</run></par>
