djQlpYviJiBKab7Zpmu14trdbHGWeNeZt3pZIKoVXmhshmpOathm5F2qLVtCuSiRsttqy2uv4ZZr
7rkmBgQAOw==
</gif></picture><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>7.  Select the Company name by either using the arrow </run><picture
 height='15px' width='18px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhEgAPAOIAAP///7i4uAAAAHh4eKioqAAAAAAAAAAAACwAAAAAEgAPAEAIXAABCBxIsOBA
AgACJAzAMICAhQwHPBSosKFFixIBIAQgoKPHjx8JXhzJUCDCigxBNsx4EiLJABkNypxJc6bCmgIn
JnRJkuVOix4h+kT5EubDlgOSKl2aVCfOggEBADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> and choosing your company from the list or typing in the first few letters of the company name and then moving to the next field using either the cursor key or your mouse.  If the Company is not in the database, the system will ask you if you want it added. If you would like it to be added, fill in all of the info that is requested and an email will be automatically sent to the Admin person requesting it be added.  Note that the Company name, the phone number and the fax are mandatory fields.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>8.  The Currency should have been populated after choosing the Company.  If not, select the currency the order will be in (e.g. CAD, USD).  Note that the GST is not applied if the currency is not CAD.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><picture height='32px' width='214px'><border style='solid' width='1px'
 dropshadow='true'/><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
