<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>11. When the order's information are complete, press the "Save" button.  The system will validate the order's information and prompt you if something is missing.  At that point, the Order is considered a draft and no email has been sent to the Admin yet.  If the validations pass, you can close the order and return later to add more information or to mail it to the Admin.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><picture height='35px' width='72px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
