</gif></picture><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>12. When ready to send the order to the Admin, press the button "Save" and then click on "Mail to Admin".  Note that the system will ask you to save the order if it has not been done already.  An email will be sent to the Admin.  You will receive an email when the Admin will action the Order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
