<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>13. La touche «Sortie» permet de fermer le document.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
